An `ok` `policySnapshot` at the recorded base commit supplies the blobs for `loadRepoPolicy` and `loadAgentInstructionFiles` (`src/review/runReviewForWorkItem.ts`, `src/prWorkspace/policySnapshot.ts`). Only `ok` binds `.mdc` rules and root `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` / `REVIEW.md`. Head copies of those paths render through `renderProposedPolicyChanges` (`src/review/proposedPolicyChanges.ts`) wrapped by `wrapUntrustedBlock` (`src/prompts/shared/safety.ts`). Verification reads `.mdc` only from the same snapshot. Ask, describe, and triage receive neither binding block. Caps stay `MAX_AGENT_INSTRUCTION_BYTES` and `MAX_AGENT_INSTRUCTION_FILE_BYTES` (`src/settings/reviewConstants.ts`). Guard: `test/agentInstructionFiles.test.ts`.
